        <mxCell id="flow_legend" value="Traffic flows&#xa;&#xa;1. Team member browser → CloudFront (https://&lt;cf&gt;.cloudfront.net) → S3 UI bucket (OAC) — serves the SPA (index.html + JS/CSS bundle).&#xa;2. SPA loads → reads sessionStorage tokens → if missing redirects to /signin → user clicks Sign In → Cognito Hosted UI (poc-st21arbiter.auth) → Authorization Code flow → /callback exchanges code for IdToken + access_token + refresh_token.&#xa;3. SPA decodes IdToken locally → reads cognito:groups claim → pins personaId in PersonaContext → &lt;Guarded path&gt; permits or denies each route per the matrix above.&#xa;4. SPA → API Gateway with Bearer JWT (Cognito authorizer) for short ops: GET /findings, GET /actions, GET /audit, GET /conversations[?type=analyst|mcp], GET /conversations/{id}, GET /conversations/{id}/messages.&#xa;5. SPA → Lambda Function URL with Bearer JWT (manual JWT decode in Lambda) for /chat. Bypasses API GW's 29s integration timeout for long agent fan-outs.&#xa;6. api_handler Lambda → AgentCore InvokeAgentRuntime on the master orchestrator (sync). Master uses Strands tools sharepoint_lookup / awsconfig_lookup / zscaler_lookup → each fans out to its specialist runtime.&#xa;7. Master + specialists run Nova 2 Lite via Bedrock ConverseStream. KB retrievals hit the Bedrock KB → OpenSearch Serverless vector index policy-vectors (sourced from S3 processed bucket ingestion).&#xa;8. Master writes the session row to DDB sessions table (with chat_type=&#34;analyst&#34;|&#34;mcp&#34;) on first turn; bumps last_message_at + message_count each turn. AgentCore Memory stores the full event history (90-day TTL).&#xa;9. CodeBuild (arm64) builds agent images on deploy_agents.py runs; pushes to ECR; AgentCore Runtime pulls on update." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0F4F8;strokeColor=#3A6FA5;fontSize=11;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="1680" width="2140" height="200" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

